        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Harry Potter Quotes</title>\n<script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #111;\n    font-family: \"Trebuchet MS\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n  }\n  .panel {\n    position: relative;\n    background: #2a2118;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0;\n    left: 0;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    border: 1px dashed #6b5a44;\n    color: #8a7a63;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-end;\n    justify-content: flex-end;\n    padding: 4px;\n    z-index: 0;\n  }\n  .text-layer {\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 1;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .en {\n    font-style: italic;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    line-height: 1.35;\n    text-align: center;\n    text-shadow: 1px 1px 3px #000;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  .zh {\n    font-size: 16px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    text-align: center;\n    text-shadow: 1px 1px 3px #000;\n    margin: 6px 0 0 0;\n  }\n\n  /* Panel 1 */\n  #panel1 { height: 355px; }\n  #panel1 .text-layer { padding: 95px 18px 0 18px; }\n\n  /* Panel 2 */\n  #panel2 { height: 130px; border-top: 2px solid #000; }\n  #panel2 .text-layer { padding: 8px 30px 0 30px; }\n\n  /* Panel 3 */\n  #panel3 { height: 145px; }\n  #panel3 .text-layer { padding: 10px 30px 0 30px; }\n\n  /* Panel 4 */\n  #panel4 { height: 340px; border-top: 2px solid #000; }\n  #panel4 .text-layer { padding: 130px 22px 0 22px; }\n\n  .watermark {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 8px;\n    right: 14px;\n    z-index: 2;\n    font-size: 8px;\n    color: #d8d8d8;\n    border: 1px solid #b9b9b9;\n    border-radius: 3px;\n    padding: 2px 4px;\n    opacity: 0.85;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <!-- Panel 1: upper photo with first quote -->\n  <section class=\"panel\" id=\"panel1\">\n    <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: full panel, characters in dim interior]</div>\n    <div class=\"text-layer\">\n      <p class=\"en\">It takes a great deal of courage to stand up to your e<br>nemies, but a great deal more to stand up to your frie<br>nds.——Dumbledore</p>\n      <p class=\"zh\">要挺身而出对抗敌人的确需要很大的勇气，但要挺身而<br>出反抗朋友却需要更大的勇气。——邓布利多</p>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Panel 2: second quote English -->\n  <section class=\"panel\" id=\"panel2\">\n    <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: dark background, lower part of upper image]</div>\n    <div class=\"text-layer\">\n      <p class=\"en\">We've all got both light and darkness inside us. What<br>matters is the part we choose to act on. That's who<br>we really are.——Sirius</p>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Panel 3: second quote Chinese -->\n  <section class=\"panel\" id=\"panel3\">\n    <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: window light, interior]</div>\n    <div class=\"text-layer\">\n      <p class=\"zh\">每个人心中都有阳光和阴暗的一面。重要的是我们选择<br>成为什么，那才是真正的我们。——小天狼星</p>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Panel 4: lower photo with third quote -->\n  <section class=\"panel\" id=\"panel4\">\n    <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: full panel, character standing in classroom]</div>\n    <div class=\"watermark\">@之森绿 | 小红书</div>\n    <div class=\"text-layer\">\n      <p class=\"en\">Differences of habit and language are nothing at all if<br>our aims are identical and our hearts are open.<br>——Dumbledore</p>\n      <p class=\"zh\">如果我们目标一致，敞开心扉，即便习惯和语言不同，<br>那都不是事。——邓布利多</p>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
